{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"X\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"维持尊严更多表现为内在的自我稳住、守分寸和保持体面，具体行动的呈现相对弱一些。\",\n    \"后段逐渐转向接纳旧日归属与当下生活并存，拉扯有所收束。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"主线逐渐偏向离开后是否回去的选择，以及对未来孤独、缺少陪伴的担忧，去留问题压过了维持尊严与怀念之间的整体拉扯。\",\n    \"对旧日生活的怀念逐渐收窄为对人际亲近、被当作自己人和有人陪伴的渴望，未充分涵盖更广泛的旧日生活与归属感。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"X始终同时保留维护体面与怀念旧日归属两条线，而且两者反复交织、彼此影响，较完整地呈现了Center的核心拉扯。Y虽然也有两者，但逐渐把故事重心转向是否回去以及如何应对孤独，因而更接近一个相关但更具体的去留困境。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "97f4368c-595f-49c6-827f-94eab0df791c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T075528112900Z", "elapsed_seconds": 24.093, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T07:55:52.214558+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "219dde5064c2bc5acbc5a357e9d4af874d5340d841271c398163313ac05d5624", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eed